### Create expense
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/expense/addExpense
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": "100",
  "category": "CLOTHING",
  "description": "Test description"
}

### Remove expense

DELETE http://localhost:8080/v1/expense/removeExpense/1

### Update expense

PUT http://localhost:8080/v1/expense/updateExpense/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": "200",
  "category": "HEALTH",
  "description": "Second description"
}

### List expenses

GET http://localhost:8080/v1/expense/listExpenses

### Filter expenses

GET http://localhost:8080/v1/expense/filterExpenses/10080